1/ Connect your laptop to the Staubli robot using the Ethernet cable.
Check the network configuration from the robot teach pendant and configure the Ethernet interface on your laptop with a static IP address on the same subnet.

2/ On the Staubli controller, launch the program named ros_server.

\i If the popup message:
"Please reset E-Stop"
appears while all emergency stops are already released:
press and engage one E-Stop,
release it,
then press the blue safety reset button. \i

3/ In a first terminal :
ros2 launch real_commander pos_command.launch.py 
to correctly initialize moveit and the topics you need

4/ In a second terminal :
ros2 launch staubli_val3_driver robot_interface_streaming.launch.py robot_ip:=172.31.0.1
to establish communication with the staubli

5/ In a third terminal :
ros2 run real_commander position_commander 
tis is where you enter commands to move the robot.
example : 2 0.1 moves joint 2 by +0.1 rad. 6 -0.05 moves joint 6 by -0.05 rad.